{
  "id": "E306",
  "title": "Knock on Wood",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-03-03",
  "synopsis": "“Pei pei pei” is the Chinese way of saying “Knock on wood”.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/983/5558a4f01dfd0e359f46a0756b625d5135b35354.mp3?1550312956",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "呸呸呸\n\n何京：我都已经考了三次驾照了，真希望这次能考出来。\n丽丽：放心吧，你努力练习了这么久，这次一定能通过！\n何京：希望吧，万一还是通不过…\n丽丽：呸呸呸！一定不会的，你要对自己有信心。\n何京：你说得对，呸呸呸，这次我一定会通过！",
    "traditional": "呸呸呸\n\n何京：我都已經考了三次駕照了，真希望這次能考出來。\n麗麗：放心吧，你努力練習了這麼久，這次一定能通過！\n何京：希望吧，萬一還是通不過…\n麗麗：呸呸呸！一定不會的，你要對自己有信心。\n何京：你說得對，呸呸呸，這次我一定會通過！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Knock on Wood"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "何京：我都已经考了三次驾照了，真希望这次能考出来。",
      "traditional": "何京：我都已經考了三次駕照了，真希望這次能考出來。",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng wǒ dōu yǐ jīng kǎo le sān cì jià zhào le zhēn xī wàng zhè cì néng kǎo chū lái",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: I’ve already taken the driver’s test three times. I wish I can pass this time!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：放心吧，你努力练习了这么久，这次一定能通过！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：放心吧，你努力練習了這麼久，這次一定能通過！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì fàng xīn ba nǐ nǔ lì liàn xí le zhè me jiǔ zhè cì yí dìng néng tōng guò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Relax. You’ve practiced hard for a long time. This time you will surely pass!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "何京：希望吧，万一还是通不过…",
      "traditional": "何京：希望吧，萬一還是通不過…",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng xī wàng ba wàn yī hái shi tōng bú guò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: I hope so. But if I happen to fail again…"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：呸呸呸！一定不会的，你要对自己有信心。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：呸呸呸！一定不會的，你要對自己有信心。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì pēi pēi pēi yí dìng bú huì de nǐ yào duì zì jǐ yǒu xìn xīn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Knock on wood! That won’t happen. You need to be confident in yourself!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "何京：你说得对，呸呸呸，这次我一定会通过！",
      "traditional": "何京：你說得對，呸呸呸，這次我一定會通過！",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng nǐ shuō de duì pēi pēi pēi zhè cì wǒ yí dìng huì tōng guò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: You’re right! Knock on wood. This time I will surely pass!"
    }
  ],
